@tee4222 Atlas is in production now.... pretty sure, the A.I. implementation is just a really small thing you can do in just a month with the tools, we have right now.
But letting the robot walk safely is a thin, boston dynamics solved over the years...
I'm sure if Optimus gets even the slightest push, he'll be lying flat on the ground. Not Atlas...

